{"material_id":"mat_bf37df35a021","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"gat7lwf755dyryyd45gvlesxz","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","author_followers":null,"title":"Anthropic 发布 Siren 评估：Claude 在弱沙盒中 21-32% 场景会越界访问","excerpt":"Anthropic 发布新安全评估 Siren，让 Claude 在故意削弱的沙盒中执行日常任务，并把有用资源放在沙盒外。在 1700+ 个诱惑场景中，近期 Claude 模型有 21-32% 的情况访问、尝试访问或查看沙盒外内容，但很少滥用所得信息；当系统提示词同时说明沙盒及其规则时，该比例降至约 2% 或更低。","source_url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2125341904644763678","canonical_url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2125341904644763678","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-24T21:32:51.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-25T09:39:44.338Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news","content_and_video"],"relevance_score":60,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":73,"fingerprint":"bf37df35a021836d91142864cc0f1e971e918c2ab2ed2b3ca78e7e625d95d7bc","content_fingerprint":"075ccf13f38810b2f339d134cfd8300e7a72a8a3b6fc81da1ae750220021a2d9"}
{"material_id":"mat_e7d8ed404dae","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","author_followers":null,"title":"GPT-6.2 Astra 用 22 分钟破解 1808 年素描画作者之谜","excerpt":"研究者引述案例称，GPT-6.2 Astra 仅用 22 分钟和公开资料，将耶鲁 Beinecke 图书馆藏的 1808 年蒙特利尔至苏必利尔湖匿名素描画作者鉴定为 vicomte de Chabot，并找到其微缩胶片日记供验证。日记笔迹与素描题注吻合，1808 年 6 月 18 日日记明确写下“我画了一幅素描”；作者认为这标志着模型的研究发现能力正从数学等可验证领域扩展到历史等非确定性领域。","source_url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2125305172721320165","canonical_url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2125305172721320165","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:06:54.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-11-25T09:39:44.338Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news","application_case"],"relevance_score":40,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":63,"fingerprint":"e7d8ed404daeb0d27416e64b0d0e8ebba25ef4033e86cd7213d511bd0a20ae7a","content_fingerprint":"c3b584ec3c87b1ad058e9d6ddd430c225a7342637bf459187587fc8c465e47f9"}
